WEBVTT

00:03.260 --> 00:04.511
Ow…

00:04.970 --> 00:07.764
Hmm, you should really have
a doctor take a look at that.

00:07.807 --> 00:09.391
You think I don't know that?

00:09.433 --> 00:10.767
I'm asking you to administer
first aid now,

00:10.810 --> 00:11.936
before I go to the hospital!

00:12.061 --> 00:13.270
Fine, you can settle down.

00:14.855 --> 00:17.107
H-Hey, Fugo, you aren't—

00:17.149 --> 00:19.442
Hey!

00:20.319 --> 00:21.987
For the love of…!

00:22.071 --> 00:24.031
Holy shit! Staples!

00:24.073 --> 00:25.365
Whoa, he actually
sealed him up good,

00:25.408 --> 00:26.450
like a freakin' manga!

00:26.492 --> 00:30.037
Narancia, grab the duct tape and
wrap up his midsection, will ya?

00:30.079 --> 00:30.954
Gotcha.

00:30.996 --> 00:33.456
You don't think
this could get infected?

00:33.707 --> 00:35.375
You'll be fine, don't worry.

00:35.418 --> 00:37.211
You know, it's actually kind
of growing on me.

00:37.253 --> 00:38.545
Mind if I chime in?

00:40.506 --> 00:42.549
Ragazzi, you've made me
proud today.

00:43.551 --> 00:46.720
It's thanks to you men that
we made it to Capri alive.

00:47.430 --> 00:50.266
Our seafaring attacker and
Mista's unfortunate bullseye

00:50.307 --> 00:51.975
are out cold and
in safekeeping on the boat.

00:52.268 --> 00:53.727
They are of no concern to us now.

00:53.769 --> 00:58.269
Then let's get going…
That ten billion lira is waiting!

00:58.858 --> 01:00.693
So where'd you hide it, Bucciarati?

01:01.235 --> 01:02.819
A hidden safe at the bank?

01:02.903 --> 01:05.822
Or let me guess, you buried it in
some cave on the island.

01:07.533 --> 01:09.243
I need you to wait a little longer…

01:10.453 --> 01:11.620
What's the problem?

01:11.829 --> 01:14.164
Why the concern with time
all of a sudden?

01:15.082 --> 01:16.083
Shh!

01:18.294 --> 01:22.339
Hey, could you like wait?
There are people still in there.

01:22.548 --> 01:24.967
You can clean this place later.

01:26.010 --> 01:28.345
So your name must be…
public toilette.

01:28.429 --> 01:31.014
Huh? What'd you say?

01:32.475 --> 01:35.019
If your name was public toilette,

01:35.102 --> 01:36.853
then that would make
this place your house.

01:37.313 --> 01:40.024
You have the right to call
the shots in your own house.

01:40.149 --> 01:42.860
But if this isn't your house,

01:42.943 --> 01:45.654
then you have no business
telling me what to do.

01:45.696 --> 01:48.240
Huh? Hold it, moron!

01:48.324 --> 01:51.035
What don't you get about
the words stay out!

01:51.660 --> 01:52.827
CRACK

01:57.333 --> 01:59.877
W-What the hell do
you think you're doing?!

02:00.294 --> 02:01.378
- Fine, let's do this!
- What… the hell?

02:01.462 --> 02:02.087
Another wielder?

02:02.087 --> 02:04.255
I'll slice you clean open!

02:04.340 --> 02:05.341
Wait!

02:05.799 --> 02:07.926
- Everyone, stop Narancia!
- Why did you stop me?!

02:08.052 --> 02:09.803
There's a possibility
those two could be…

02:11.514 --> 02:12.890
I know that voice…

02:13.474 --> 02:15.142
So I see we've kept you waiting.

02:16.018 --> 02:18.228
Gentleman, salute.

02:18.812 --> 02:22.440
This is Mr. Pericolo,
a capo from Passione.

02:22.525 --> 02:25.236
I'm here for the ten billion lira…

02:25.861 --> 02:27.320
Bucciarati.

02:39.083 --> 02:43.583
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

02:44.421 --> 02:47.924
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

02:49.677 --> 02:54.177
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

02:54.848 --> 02:58.685
<i>But I will never give in</i>

02:58.727 --> 03:03.227
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

03:10.531 --> 03:15.031
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

03:23.586 --> 03:28.086
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

03:29.592 --> 03:34.092
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

03:36.640 --> 03:39.809
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

03:39.852 --> 03:44.352
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

03:45.107 --> 03:49.607
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

03:59.455 --> 04:03.955
EPISODE 09
THE FIRST MISSION FROM THE BOSS

04:01.957 --> 04:04.230
I reached out to him as soon as
we arrived on the island.

04:04.793 --> 04:07.045
Mr. Pericolo was kind enough
to meet all of us here

04:07.129 --> 04:09.005
to receive the money.

04:09.173 --> 04:11.633
<i>So he's a capo from Passione…</i>

04:11.800 --> 04:14.636
We are humbled and grateful for
your visit here today.

04:14.678 --> 04:15.762
Don't be silly.

04:15.804 --> 04:19.224
I was the one who requested
your travel here to this island.

04:19.808 --> 04:21.684
Ragazzi, please, at ease.

04:23.145 --> 04:24.813
So you must be the rookie.

04:24.855 --> 04:25.856
Si.

04:25.939 --> 04:28.066
Bucciarati's told me all about you.

04:28.484 --> 04:32.196
You are part of Passione now.
You are a part of the famiglia.

04:32.363 --> 04:36.367
Please don't hesitate to
call me Mr. Pericolo.

04:37.076 --> 04:38.494
I appreciate that, sir.

04:40.204 --> 04:42.706
You there,
pardon the rough reception earlier.

04:42.748 --> 04:46.585
I must say she is not fond of
unsolicited human contact.

04:47.336 --> 04:48.378
Sure.

04:48.796 --> 04:50.422
- You…
- You mean, "Yes, sir!"

04:50.589 --> 04:51.798
Mr. Pericolo,

04:52.299 --> 04:54.634
if I may,
why the elaborate disguise?

04:55.302 --> 04:58.471
I have my reasons.
I'll clarify later.

04:58.847 --> 05:01.599
Now, more critically,
do you really have it?

05:01.975 --> 05:05.687
The ten billion lira contribution
to the famiglia.

05:05.854 --> 05:08.064
Yes, I have it right here.

05:08.941 --> 05:10.943
What? What did you just say?!

05:11.026 --> 05:12.068
He said it's right here!

05:12.194 --> 05:13.528
Here?!

05:14.113 --> 05:16.281
Bucciarati, where is it?

05:16.615 --> 05:18.825
Sorry, sir, all I see are urinals…

05:21.036 --> 05:22.912
PLOP

05:23.497 --> 05:25.582
You hid it inside of that?!

05:25.624 --> 05:27.417
Can't deny it was secure, but…

05:27.543 --> 05:30.837
Holy moly, if only those guys knew
what they were pissing on!

05:32.089 --> 05:34.341
Hmm… It's authentic.

05:35.050 --> 05:36.676
This necklace alone
is worth at least

05:36.719 --> 05:38.929
seven or eight hundred million.

05:39.638 --> 05:40.680
Bucciarati,

05:40.889 --> 05:43.516
I won't badger you for details
on how you obtained

05:43.559 --> 05:45.143
such a large cache of riches.

05:45.227 --> 05:47.687
The famiglia cares not
about your processes,

05:47.730 --> 05:49.815
only that you follow through
with the funds.

05:49.940 --> 05:52.108
Wait, you're already
putting it away?

05:52.192 --> 05:54.319
Could I touch it just a little?

05:54.486 --> 05:56.279
Or at least a whiff?

05:57.448 --> 06:00.159
This treasure is proof incarnate…

06:00.534 --> 06:04.538
That before us today stands a man
of tremendous intellect and faith.

06:05.748 --> 06:07.374
Congratulazioni, Bucciarati.

06:07.416 --> 06:11.253
I hereby promote you to capo.

06:11.420 --> 06:14.423
We did it… He's capo!

06:14.548 --> 06:17.884
Bucciarati's finally a capo!

06:18.427 --> 06:20.679
Now that Polpo
is no longer with us,

06:20.763 --> 06:24.391
you are the successor to
the entirety of his territory.

06:24.433 --> 06:27.060
You'll be overseeing all matters
directly and indirectly related to

06:27.102 --> 06:28.978
interests of the famiglia in Napoli

06:29.021 --> 06:31.273
including gambling, extortion,
port contraband,

06:31.315 --> 06:34.151
as well as restaurant
and hotel operations.

06:34.234 --> 06:36.527
Fifty percent belongs to
the famiglia.

06:36.779 --> 06:39.990
The rest is yours for the taking.

06:40.783 --> 06:41.909
<i>Holy shit!</i>

06:41.950 --> 06:43.910
<i>Incredible, all that power,
and just like that!</i>

06:44.203 --> 06:46.330
<i>With Bucciarati's
smarts and charisma,</i>

06:46.413 --> 06:49.374
<i>we'll be rolling in dough!</i>

06:49.541 --> 06:52.043
<i>But it's like everything's
been set in motion</i>

06:52.127 --> 06:55.171
<i>since that new guy
Giorno go there.</i>

06:55.631 --> 06:57.382
<i>He's like some kind of
crazy good luck charm.</i>

06:57.633 --> 06:59.551
By the way,

06:59.802 --> 07:01.303
I realize you haven't had much time

07:01.345 --> 07:04.056
to digest your new duties
as Polpo's successor,

07:04.139 --> 07:08.518
but he had left one job unfinished.

07:09.645 --> 07:13.357
Naturally, the responsibility
of such business

07:13.398 --> 07:15.691
now falls onto your shoulders,
Bucciarati.

07:16.318 --> 07:18.320
Are you willing
to accept this mission?

07:18.362 --> 07:20.614
Polpo's unfinished business?

07:21.907 --> 07:24.701
It's a direct order from the boss.

07:25.828 --> 07:28.205
The… boss?

07:28.288 --> 07:29.289
The boss…

07:29.456 --> 07:32.041
The boss no one's ever met?

07:32.084 --> 07:34.377
An order… directly from him?

07:34.753 --> 07:37.797
Si, and now you get to hear
the words from my mouth.

07:39.967 --> 07:43.637
You are to safeguard
the boss's daughter…

07:43.679 --> 07:45.722
and at the expense of your life.

07:46.014 --> 07:47.015
E tutto.

07:47.850 --> 07:48.851
Daughter?

07:48.892 --> 07:50.643
<i>- The boss…</i>
- Did he say "daughter"?

07:50.686 --> 07:52.688
<i>- The daughter of the boss we were</i>
- The boss has a daughter?

07:52.729 --> 07:55.440
<i>Planning on tracking down
and eliminating?</i>

07:55.691 --> 07:57.984
Your safeguarding obligations
begin now.

07:58.026 --> 08:00.194
I hand her to thee.

08:01.780 --> 08:03.072
Hand her over?

08:03.699 --> 08:04.741
Bucciarati!

08:05.200 --> 08:06.534
Could that guy be…?

08:07.035 --> 08:09.495
No, this woman…

08:10.038 --> 08:12.123
She must be the boss's daughter!

08:13.166 --> 08:15.042
Could this person be… her?

08:15.878 --> 08:18.297
Mind if I… take a quick…?

08:18.422 --> 08:20.298
Knock yourself out, Trish.

08:24.011 --> 08:26.179
For now, stay by her side.

08:26.430 --> 08:28.306
The mandate is in effect.

08:29.516 --> 08:30.767
Bucciarati.

08:33.395 --> 08:36.773
Her name is Trish Una, age fifteen.

08:37.274 --> 08:39.901
Of course, the name Una
comes from her mother.

08:39.943 --> 08:42.070
It has no association
with the boss.

08:42.321 --> 08:46.325
Trish has also never met the boss.

08:46.742 --> 08:49.953
Bucciarati, as you know,
no one has knowledge

08:50.037 --> 08:52.289
of the boss's true identity.

08:52.456 --> 08:55.709
But of course,
even the boss has a past,

08:55.751 --> 08:58.670
and that of his youth
is particularly intriguing.

08:59.129 --> 09:01.506
It was two months ago.

09:01.590 --> 09:03.592
In a hospital
in a small town of Calabria,

09:03.634 --> 09:07.304
a woman named Donatella
succumbed to illness and died.

09:08.096 --> 09:10.556
Just days before her death,

09:10.599 --> 09:15.099
she initiated a frantic search
for a man named Solido Naso.

09:15.604 --> 09:18.815
That man was Trish's father.

09:18.941 --> 09:21.276
I can only assume
it was a final act of love

09:21.318 --> 09:23.862
for the daughter she knew would
soon be left to fend for herself.

09:24.363 --> 09:25.405
But…

09:25.656 --> 09:28.408
Naso doesn't exist.

09:28.450 --> 09:32.950
It was nothing more than an alias
the boss used in his youth.

09:33.789 --> 09:34.831
Correct?

09:36.249 --> 09:39.335
He who seeks Naso, however,
must exercise great caution.

09:39.419 --> 09:42.839
Anyone with any standing
in Passione

09:42.881 --> 09:45.174
knows to take these words to heart.

09:45.258 --> 09:48.177
To peer into the depths
of the boss's past

09:48.637 --> 09:51.014
is to defy the famiglia itself.

09:51.556 --> 09:54.642
Word of Donatella
spread like wildfire.

09:54.685 --> 09:58.313
With news of a daughter,
the rumors exploded.

09:58.522 --> 10:01.900
Of course, the hearsay reached
the boss too.

10:02.317 --> 10:04.360
Not surprisingly,
his resolution was swift.

10:04.820 --> 10:08.824
By way of several intermediaries,
he extended his order.

10:09.074 --> 10:13.119
Immediately upon Donatella's death,
I was to become her new guardian.

10:13.495 --> 10:16.331
He must have known instinctively.

10:16.999 --> 10:20.585
He lived his life without knowing
she had ever existed,

10:20.669 --> 10:24.881
yet suddenly, he knew…
Trish was his own flesh and blood.

10:25.841 --> 10:28.677
Upon taking Trish into my custody,

10:28.844 --> 10:33.344
I discovered that someone
was trying to hunt her down.

10:33.932 --> 10:36.601
Had the directive arrived
thirty minutes later,

10:36.685 --> 10:39.354
I have no doubt Trish's pursuers
would have taken her away.

10:39.396 --> 10:40.563
Then…

10:41.815 --> 10:43.775
they would have surely killed her.

10:43.859 --> 10:46.862
But who… who would be after her?

10:47.029 --> 10:49.322
Traitors to the famiglia.

10:49.489 --> 10:51.699
There's no telling
how many there are.

10:51.742 --> 10:53.034
They want to overthrow the boss

10:53.076 --> 10:56.245
and take control of
the drug trafficking routes.

10:56.580 --> 10:57.581
Drugs…

10:57.914 --> 11:02.414
They're convinced she has
secret intel on the boss.

11:03.086 --> 11:07.173
They want intelligence on
how to topple the boss.

11:07.883 --> 11:12.383
But Trish knows no such thing,
she is just a vulnerable teenager.

11:13.263 --> 11:14.931
If I may… How long will…?

11:15.015 --> 11:16.641
Seven days…

11:16.725 --> 11:19.185
It very likely could be
even shorter.

11:19.394 --> 11:21.604
Until, of course,
the boss tracks down the betrayers

11:21.646 --> 11:23.272
and eliminates them.

11:23.899 --> 11:27.611
Leave this island immediately,
and place her under concealment.

11:27.778 --> 11:29.696
The only two people who are
aware of our little arrangement

11:29.738 --> 11:31.740
are the boss and myself.

11:31.990 --> 11:33.157
Mr. Pericolo.

11:33.492 --> 11:37.496
The mandate was originally intended
for Polpo, am I correct, signore?

11:38.413 --> 11:39.705
Which means…

11:39.790 --> 11:41.958
Our adversaries wield the Stand…

11:43.460 --> 11:45.628
Si, I'd say that is a good guess,
my boy.

11:47.005 --> 11:50.091
In all likelihood, they are
operating in teams as well.

11:50.258 --> 11:52.802
We don't yet know
how many there are.

11:53.595 --> 11:55.847
You should know that
I have no Stand power to speak of.

11:55.972 --> 11:58.641
I have done all I can
to assist you, ragazzi.

11:58.892 --> 12:01.978
If I obtain further intel,
you will hear from me.

12:16.743 --> 12:17.660
Um…

12:17.744 --> 12:19.495
You talking to me?

12:19.538 --> 12:22.707
Yeah, will you be… um…

12:23.625 --> 12:27.086
Will you be escorting me
from here on out?

12:28.296 --> 12:30.214
Yes, that's correct.

12:30.757 --> 12:33.009
The six of us are here for you.

12:33.301 --> 12:36.429
We will protect you with our lives.

12:36.638 --> 12:37.597
I see.

12:38.223 --> 12:42.018
Then would you mind
taking off that jacket?

12:43.353 --> 12:45.646
My jacket? Why?

12:45.772 --> 12:47.690
Don't worry,
just take the thing off.

12:47.732 --> 12:50.735
Believe me, I have no desire
to see you in any state of undress.

12:51.319 --> 12:53.070
You've made that clear.

12:56.658 --> 12:58.993
I'm out of handkerchiefs.
Go buy me one.

12:59.035 --> 13:03.456
Also, a spare pair of nylons
and Givenchy Blush No. 2.

13:03.498 --> 13:06.959
Oh, and they better be the ones
with the garter at the thigh.

13:07.169 --> 13:09.254
Don't forget Vogue Italia,
the latest issue…

13:09.337 --> 13:10.796
and some mineral water.

13:11.339 --> 13:12.840
But it has to be from France.

13:12.883 --> 13:15.635
I'd rather die
than drink that other stuff.

13:16.178 --> 13:18.054
When you're done marveling
at the scenery,

13:18.138 --> 13:19.722
you can get a move on
that shopping list, okay?

13:23.476 --> 13:26.228
<i>Protect the daughter
of the boss, huh?</i>

13:27.022 --> 13:29.733
<i>One minute, we're trying to
hunt down the mysterious boss,</i>

13:29.816 --> 13:32.902
<i>the next, we're face to face
with a very real connection.</i>

13:33.862 --> 13:35.488
<i>There's no question,
we have to do this.</i>

13:36.156 --> 13:37.824
<i>If we really
follow through on this,</i>

13:37.866 --> 13:39.576
<i>the boss will give Bucciarati</i>

13:39.618 --> 13:41.703
<i>the same kind of trust
he gave Polpo.</i>

13:42.370 --> 13:45.623
<i>But if we fail,
it'll mean our lives.</i>

13:46.249 --> 13:49.919
<i>There's not one of us here
that doesn't know that.</i>

13:53.423 --> 13:56.759
What's wrong with you?
Chill out, sweetie baby.

13:57.093 --> 13:59.261
I'm just trying to
show you some love.

14:00.055 --> 14:02.057
POLPO SHOOTS HIMSELF DEAD IN
NAPOLI PRISON AT 9:25 THIS MORNING.

14:00.764 --> 14:01.890
Hey, come on.

14:02.224 --> 14:06.102
Quit moving around.
I can't read this thing. Shit…

14:07.020 --> 14:11.520
"Polpo shoots himself dead in
Napoli Prison 9:25 this morning."

14:14.236 --> 14:18.736
Terrific… I was sure it'd be Polpo.

14:18.949 --> 14:21.201
Who is it, then?

14:21.910 --> 14:25.705
Who's looking after that
disappearing act Trish?

14:27.165 --> 14:27.915
FIND THEM

14:28.166 --> 14:28.916
FIND THEM

14:29.167 --> 14:29.959
FIND THEM

14:31.378 --> 14:33.922
Well, then…

14:33.964 --> 14:36.132
Find them, eh?

14:36.216 --> 14:39.344
Who was more capable than Polpo?

14:39.761 --> 14:41.971
First and foremost,
he'd have to be a capo.

14:42.222 --> 14:44.766
No one else would be assigned
such an important job.

14:44.808 --> 14:48.144
This guy would have to be
a Stand user.

14:48.812 --> 14:52.190
Who the hell checks
all those boxes?

14:57.070 --> 14:58.112
BUCCIARATI, NEW CAPO
ABBACCHIO, MISTA
GIORNO, FUGO, NARANCIA
WE MIGHT BE ORDINARY MAFIOSI,
BUT SOON, WE'LL RISE TO THE TOP
OF THE FAMIGLIA!
IF THEY TRY TO ATTACK US,
WE'LL SLAUGHTER THEM

14:58.154 --> 14:58.904
PERICOLO HAS THE TRUST
OF THE BOSS AS CAPO

14:58.154 --> 14:58.904
HUNT DOWN AND WIPE OUT THE TRAITORS.
YOU WILL PROTECT MY DAUGHTER

14:58.905 --> 14:59.614
DAUGHTER (TRISH), 15 YRS
THE BOSS'S DAUGHTER
HAS TO KNOW SOMETHING.
EVEN IF SHE DOESN'T,
SHE'S STILL COMING WITH US

14:59.614 --> 15:00.364
WE'RE NOT PERFECT,
BUT WE REFUSE TO SIT BACK AND
WATCH YOU PROFIT FROM DRUGS
AND THE SUFFERING OF OTHERS.
(WE'LL FIND OUT
YOUR TRUE IDENTITY ONE DAY)

15:00.365 --> 15:00.990
THE TRAITORS
WE DON'T KNOW HOW MANY THERE ARE,
BUT THEY'RE DEFINITELY STAND USERS

15:04.286 --> 15:06.079
Groceries, check.

15:07.122 --> 15:08.832
Surroundings, check.

15:08.873 --> 15:10.374
Let's see…

15:10.709 --> 15:13.753
I go through here,
make a turn here,

15:13.795 --> 15:15.379
end up back on this street

15:15.714 --> 15:17.799
and then head in
the opposite direction.

15:17.841 --> 15:19.717
Okay!

15:25.807 --> 15:27.975
<i>Narancia, you ready…?</i>

15:28.101 --> 15:30.019
<i>That is a list of the groceries
I need you to buy,</i>

15:30.103 --> 15:31.854
<i>along with everything else.</i>

15:31.896 --> 15:34.064
<i>These are the keys to the car.</i>

15:34.274 --> 15:36.859
<i>Narancia,
now I know you can do this.</i>

15:36.943 --> 15:38.653
<i>You will pull this off</i>

15:39.404 --> 15:40.405
<i>Okay.</i>

15:40.613 --> 15:44.908
<i>Now listen, no one has
the faintest idea we're here.</i>

15:45.118 --> 15:47.995
<i>Not even the vintners
working out front.</i>

15:48.496 --> 15:50.998
<i>When you're done with the shopping,
I want you to retrace your path,</i>

15:51.041 --> 15:53.710
<i>then do it again, more times
than you think you should</i>

15:54.336 --> 15:56.546
<i>Then make a u-turn
every once and a while.</i>

15:56.671 --> 15:59.840
<i>That way, you'll know whether
anyone is tailing you.</i>

15:59.924 --> 16:04.424
<i>Then I want you to get into the car
I left for you in the parking lot.</i>

16:04.929 --> 16:06.764
<i>Then, and only then,
do I want you to come home.</i>

16:06.848 --> 16:09.225
<i>No one should have any inkling that</i>

16:09.309 --> 16:10.768
<i>we are looking after
the boss's daughter,</i>

16:11.353 --> 16:14.230
<i>but just in case there is,</i>

16:14.272 --> 16:17.275
<i>that should keep anyone
of four trail.</i>

16:17.525 --> 16:18.567
<i>Capisce?</i>

16:18.651 --> 16:20.235
<i>We need the things on that list.</i>

16:20.278 --> 16:21.654
<i>Don't get me wrong.</i>

16:21.905 --> 16:23.489
<i>But we cannot
under any circumstance</i>

16:23.531 --> 16:25.407
<i>let anyone find out
about our hideo—</i>

16:25.450 --> 16:27.827
<i>For crying out loud,
I get it, I get it!</i>

16:27.994 --> 16:29.745
<i>Just leave everything to me!</i>

16:29.954 --> 16:31.914
<i>Right, now I want you to repeat
back to me,</i>

16:31.998 --> 16:33.624
<i>everything we just talked about,
start to finish.</i>

16:33.792 --> 16:34.793
<i>Huh?</i>

16:36.586 --> 16:38.004
<i>I buy all that stuff on the list,</i>

16:38.046 --> 16:40.381
<i>then I drive around and around
in the field out th–</i>

16:40.006 --> 16:40.756
JAB

16:40.423 --> 16:40.778
<i>Ow!</i>

16:42.175 --> 16:46.429
<i>Wrong! Quit screwing around
Start all over, from the beginning!</i>

16:46.471 --> 16:47.346
<i>Huh?</i>

16:47.389 --> 16:48.640
<i>Um…</i>

16:49.432 --> 16:51.934
<i>Drive around so I don't get dizzy—</i>

16:51.559 --> 16:52.309
JAB

16:51.976 --> 16:52.331
<i>Urgh! What the hell?!</i>

16:54.896 --> 16:56.606
<i>Come on, Abbacchio!</i>

16:56.648 --> 16:58.941
<i>Tell this bastard to stop
stabbing me with the keys!</i>

16:59.025 --> 17:00.776
<i>- I'm older than he is!
- I should've never put him</i>

17:00.819 --> 17:02.529
<i>in charge of the shopping!</i>

17:03.363 --> 17:07.283
<i>Whether you two wanna keep playing
with keys is your own business.</i>

17:07.409 --> 17:10.745
<i>What I'm interested in
is Narancia's Stand</i>

17:10.787 --> 17:14.290
<i>If someone is on our heels,
he'll put an end to him.</i>

17:14.582 --> 17:17.585
<i>That's why Bucciarati gave him
the task he did.</i>

17:18.294 --> 17:20.129
<i>To make a long story short…</i>

17:20.171 --> 17:23.174
<i>I need to get my ass back here
without a soul knowing.</i>

17:23.258 --> 17:25.385
<i>No stalkers allowed!</i>

17:30.890 --> 17:32.433
Something's off.

17:32.934 --> 17:37.434
<i>My eyes tell me I'm all by myself,
but my gut says something else.</i>

17:37.897 --> 17:42.397
<i>This car that Fugo got for me
is giving me a bad vibe too.</i>

17:45.947 --> 17:46.948
Huh?

17:47.031 --> 17:50.701
Come on already.

17:50.910 --> 17:55.410
Now where oh where could you
be heading to, Narancia?

17:55.665 --> 17:56.707
That voice came from
all the way down here!

18:03.840 --> 18:07.093
Hey, stranger,
where are you headed?

18:07.260 --> 18:10.263
You keep looking behind you.

18:10.305 --> 18:13.099
You worried someone is
following you or something?

18:13.141 --> 18:14.183
- Who the hell are you?!
- Whoa, whoa, whoa,

18:14.267 --> 18:16.060
- Get out now!
- you're scaring me!

18:16.144 --> 18:18.646
That's not how you behave to
someone asking you a question.

18:18.688 --> 18:20.606
You should know you never answer
a question with a question.

18:20.648 --> 18:22.358
It really is quite rude.

18:22.442 --> 18:25.194
Shut your face, freak.
I said get out, now do it!

18:26.362 --> 18:28.280
Oh, might as well…

18:28.323 --> 18:30.408
My name's Formaggio.

18:30.617 --> 18:32.035
I'm a part of the famiglia.

18:32.660 --> 18:36.080
You are aware that Polpo
passed last night, yes?

18:36.956 --> 18:41.456
- But now, of all times,
<i>- Merda… This guy is bad news.</i>

18:42.170 --> 18:43.880
- Your trusty teammates
<i>- I don't know how he could know,</i>

18:43.922 --> 18:45.131
- just flat out disappear.
<i>- but he's on to us.</i>

18:45.173 --> 18:46.674
- It's really too bad, cause I really
<i>- I-Is he a Stand user?</i>

18:46.674 --> 18:48.717
- Needed to chat with all of you…
<i>- I-Is he a Stand user?</i>

18:48.801 --> 18:53.222
Narancia, I finally find you,
but what gives?

18:53.306 --> 18:56.058
Where's Bucciarati and the rest
of your playmates?

18:57.310 --> 18:58.269
Got me.

18:58.353 --> 19:00.813
How should I know where
they are right this second…?

19:00.939 --> 19:02.398
Did you check
the restaurants around here?

19:02.482 --> 19:04.192
This car…

19:04.234 --> 19:05.735
It's a rental, isn't it?

19:05.818 --> 19:07.569
Of course,
Bucciarati is the renter.

19:08.071 --> 19:11.074
If you don't know that,
then why are you in this car?

19:11.241 --> 19:12.242
Well?

19:12.408 --> 19:16.328
I-I always drive around
in Bucciarati's cars.

19:16.454 --> 19:19.290
I'm seventeen. I don't have a car.

19:19.415 --> 19:20.916
That's why I'm borrowing his.

19:22.835 --> 19:24.711
Oh, yeah. Did you hear?

19:24.754 --> 19:27.840
Polpo's elephantine corpse is
causing the mortician some trouble…

19:27.882 --> 19:30.050
Apparently, he can't figure out how
to incinerate the thing.

19:30.093 --> 19:33.304
There's no way to squeeze him
into the damn oven.

19:34.973 --> 19:38.476
Guess he'll have to hack
that fat calzone into tiny pieces!

19:43.982 --> 19:44.774
Shut up!

19:44.816 --> 19:47.610
Hey, I know you
thought about it too…

19:49.237 --> 19:50.238
Huh?

19:50.405 --> 19:52.573
What the hell?
Where'd that cazzo go!

19:56.995 --> 19:58.538
You totally fell for it.

19:58.705 --> 20:00.540
Such a pity.

20:00.707 --> 20:03.751
Say, Narancia,
explain to me why you fools

20:03.793 --> 20:07.296
are nowhere to be seen,
and a capo is being laid to rest?

20:07.380 --> 20:09.256
- You're gonna talk, stronzo…
- You've really done it now,

20:09.299 --> 20:10.466
- Unless you've changed your mind
- figlio di put tan a!

20:10.466 --> 20:11.633
- About my tagging along!
- figlio di put tan a!

20:11.718 --> 20:14.429
I'm gonna get you to tell me
all sorts of things!

20:14.679 --> 20:16.055
You mother…

20:16.097 --> 20:17.139
Huh?

20:17.724 --> 20:19.684
Piece of…

20:19.934 --> 20:21.310
I'll slaughter you!

20:30.945 --> 20:31.946
What is that thing?!

20:32.113 --> 20:33.823
Li'I Bomber!

20:35.074 --> 20:38.160
So he's a Stand user… Tiny Feet!

20:40.538 --> 20:41.789
BADA BADA BADA

20:43.124 --> 20:45.000
Damn you!

20:45.084 --> 20:47.377
Look at what you did to me,
you stealthy cornuto!

20:47.629 --> 20:49.297
BADA BADA BADA

20:47.712 --> 20:49.318
Bastardo, bastardo, bastardo!

20:49.714 --> 20:50.965
I'll slaughter you!
I'll slaughter you!

20:51.007 --> 20:52.133
I'll slaughter you!

20:53.676 --> 20:56.595
<i>This guy is a psycho…</i>

20:58.097 --> 21:00.057
I'll slaughter you!
I'll slaughter you!

21:01.059 --> 21:02.435
Tenacious little…!

21:02.685 --> 21:04.478
I'll slaughter you!

21:05.647 --> 21:08.358
<i>Holy shit!
He's completely blown his gasket…</i>

21:08.483 --> 21:10.526
<i>He's shooting everything
in sight like a madman!</i>

21:10.568 --> 21:14.029
<i>And I'm stuck inside this tin can
with nowhere to hide!</i>

21:14.322 --> 21:16.532
<i>This car is gonna do me in!</i>

21:18.910 --> 21:20.119
A-A bomb?!

21:20.161 --> 21:22.830
Wipe him off the earth,
Li'I Bomber!

21:24.916 --> 21:27.043
How do you like that?
And that?! And that?! And that?!

21:27.085 --> 21:28.419
You a pile of ash yet?

21:29.379 --> 21:31.547
Ow! Damn it!

21:31.589 --> 21:32.590
We get him?

21:33.341 --> 21:34.925
H-He's gone!

21:35.468 --> 21:37.386
Did the blast knock him
into the stratosphere?

21:37.428 --> 21:40.305
No… but there's not
a body part in sight!

21:40.431 --> 21:42.724
W-Where did he go?!

21:43.643 --> 21:47.396
<i>Goodness gracious…
I'm right under your nose.</i>

21:48.356 --> 21:50.483
<i>I can microfy myself</i>

21:50.566 --> 21:53.235
<i>That's my very secret weapon!</i>

21:54.195 --> 21:58.695
<i>Tiny Feet… And all those other guys
said it wasn't worth shit.</i>

22:01.035 --> 22:02.661
<i>They can talk
all the shit they want,</i>

22:02.704 --> 22:04.747
<i>but it all depends on
how you use it.</i>

22:04.831 --> 22:06.415
<i>That's how personal talents work.</i>

22:06.457 --> 22:09.460
What the hell?
I don't see him anywhere!

22:09.752 --> 22:12.713
How the hell?!
Damn it, where did he go?

22:13.005 --> 22:14.214
Is he here?

22:14.590 --> 22:17.801
The same freakin' thing happened
back in the car!

22:17.885 --> 22:20.387
- Well, go inspect your heart out.
- Where the hell did he come from?

22:20.430 --> 22:23.975
- I'm gonna buy myself some time.
- He's hiding somewhere again!

22:28.396 --> 22:29.730
It's a chick…

22:29.939 --> 22:33.233
This bastard's buying stuff
for some chick.

22:33.276 --> 22:37.530
Nylons, lipstick… designer blush!

22:37.655 --> 22:39.281
Who's all this shit for?

22:39.323 --> 22:42.701
This cagacazzo's mom…
His big sis?

22:42.869 --> 22:46.289
No way… Women are super picky
about stuff like this.

22:46.330 --> 22:48.623
They buy their own makeup
and clothes…

22:48.791 --> 22:51.668
The only chick who'd entrust a guy
with this kind of shopping list

22:51.753 --> 22:55.798
is one who is stuck at the house!

22:55.923 --> 22:58.050
This is all starting to stink
to high heaven.

22:58.092 --> 23:01.136
So my instincts were spot on.

23:01.554 --> 23:03.180
It's them, it has to be.

23:03.264 --> 23:05.557
The ones chosen to protect
the daughter of the boss

23:05.600 --> 23:07.435
was Bucciarati and
his back scratchers!

23:07.477 --> 23:10.062
I will find out their hiding place,

23:10.104 --> 23:12.439
and Narancia is going to
show me how.

23:12.523 --> 23:17.023
My powers should be working
its magic on him any minute now…

23:18.946 --> 23:22.199
<i>That bastard has got to be
around here somewhere…</i>

23:22.283 --> 23:25.244
<i>He wants to follow me back
to the guys for sure.</i>

23:25.787 --> 23:26.788
<i>But…</i>

23:27.246 --> 23:29.748
I'm gonna track down
that stinking roach and crush him!

23:29.791 --> 23:31.959
I just need to get back
and shake off this stalker.

23:32.460 --> 23:34.378
This mission is in the bag!

23:37.799 --> 23:41.594
EPISODE 10
HITMAN TEAM
